          "source": "A generic OPC UA schema snapshot hash used for schema-driven API management. When this option is provided, the provider can expose API-management endpoints without connecting to a remote OPC UA server. The hash must follow the module's schema snapshot contract with `namespaces` and `endpoints` keys",
